# ── Fallback profile: bedrock ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Selected by FALLBACK_PROFILE=bedrock. Where a call goes while the ACTIVE provider (LLM_PROFILE) is
# refusing on capacity (HTTP 429 / 503), for 120 s at a time. The region is stated here so this
# profile works whatever LLM_PROFILE names. Ids are Bedrock inference-profile ids, cross-region prefixed.
#
# Ships with a dummy key: enter the real one on the dashboard's Stack Settings page.
FALLBACK_LLM_PROVIDER=bedrock
FALLBACK_LLM_API_KEY=replace-me-in-stack-settings
FALLBACK_BEDROCK_REGION=us-east-1
FALLBACK_SMART_MODELS=us.openai.gpt-oss-120b-1:0
# The MCP summary tier (query enrichment) reads FALLBACK_SMARTER_MODELS — ONE id, as in the LLM profiles.
FALLBACK_SMARTER_MODELS=us.openai.gpt-oss-120b-1:0
FALLBACK_SMARTEST_MODELS=us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-5
